{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>But if you shall indeed listen to his voice, and I will be an enemy to your enemies.</b> And I will not spare them, after My manner of goodness — the opposite of וַאֲנִי לֹא אָחוּס עַל נִינְוֵה (Jonah 4:11)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "The opposition to Jonah 4:11 is conceptual: there God spares Nineveh out of goodness, whereas here He will not spare Israel's enemies despite that characteristic."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:58.563467849Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}